      "text": "Nasser Al-Rwaily, a survivor of an attack on King Khalid International Airport in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, has described the moment a missile struck the terminal. According to reporting by Arab News, Al-Rwaily stated he was pushing his disabled brother in a wheelchair near gate four while preparing to board a flight to perform Umrah when the attack occurred."
